-- c006-v018: ke-dwara sab prarthna aur vinati prarthna-karte-hue mein sab samay mein Atma aur ke-liye isi jagte-hue mein sab lagaataar aur vinati ke-liye sab –ke pavitron
-- c006-v019: aur ke-liye mere ki mujhe diya-jaye vachan mein kholne –ke munh mere mein sahas jatana –ko rahasya –ka susmachar
-- c006-v020: ke-liye jiske main-rajdoot-hoon mein zanzeer ki mein us-mein main-nirDar-boloon jaisa chahiye mujhe bolna
-- c006-v021: Ki par tum-jaano bhi tum –ko ke-vishay mere kya main-karta-hoon sab jatayega tumhein Tuchikos –ho priya bhai aur vishwasyogya sevak mein Prabhu
-- c006-v022: jise maine-bheja ke-pas tumhare ke-liye isi is ki tum-jaano –ko ke-vishay hamare aur voh-dilasa-de –ko dilon tumhare
-- c006-v023: Shanti –ko bhaiyon aur prem ke-sath vishwas se Parameshwar Pita aur Prabhu Yeshu Khristos
-- c006-v024: –ho anugrah ke-sath sab –ke prem-karne-waalon –se Prabhu hamare Yeshu Khristos mein avinaasheeta

